{"4421740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AstroSki", "steam_appid": 4421740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4782670, 4856040], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to race down spectacular slopes set across distant planets, where speed, precision, and quick reflexes are the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro Ski</strong> is a VR arcade skiing game where you'll take on a variety of courses, avoid obstacles, follow the racing line, and aim for the fastest time possible. Each planet features its own unique environment and gameplay elements, creating new challenges and keeping every race fresh and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed specifically for virtual reality, the gameplay is easy to pick up while offering plenty of room to master your skills. Whether you're looking for quick arcade sessions or trying to beat your personal best, Astro Ski delivers a fun and immersive VR skiing experience.<br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/80a96f6b7ce1aa50dc3e76f998f3a8dc.poster.avif?t=1785829370\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/80a96f6b7ce1aa50dc3e76f998f3a8dc.webm?t=1785829370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/80a96f6b7ce1aa50dc3e76f998f3a8dc.mp4?t=1785829370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and intuitive VR arcade skiing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across multiple sci-fi planets, each with its own unique atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct environments featuring planet-specific obstacles and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Courses designed to test your reflexes, precision, and control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes offering different ways to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based challenges that encourage replayability and continuous improvement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful, energetic cartoon-inspired visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable single-player VR experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/e1a77ab6ceaa5a6496c49252b993208f.poster.avif?t=1785829370\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/e1a77ab6ceaa5a6496c49252b993208f.webm?t=1785829370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/e1a77ab6ceaa5a6496c49252b993208f.mp4?t=1785829370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback is essential to help us improve the game and make it even more fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out all the levels, let us know what you enjoyed, what you think could be improved, and report any bugs you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay updated on all the latest development news, follow us on our social media and, most importantly, join the Lagzilla Discord: see you there!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to race down spectacular slopes set across distant planets, where speed, precision, and quick reflexes are the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro Ski</strong> is a VR arcade skiing game where you'll take on a variety of courses, avoid obstacles, follow the racing line, and aim for the fastest time possible. Each planet features its own unique environment and gameplay elements, creating new challenges and keeping every race fresh and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed specifically for virtual reality, the gameplay is easy to pick up while offering plenty of room to master your skills. Whether you're looking for quick arcade sessions or trying to beat your personal best, Astro Ski delivers a fun and immersive VR skiing experience.<br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/80a96f6b7ce1aa50dc3e76f998f3a8dc.poster.avif?t=1785829370\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/80a96f6b7ce1aa50dc3e76f998f3a8dc.webm?t=1785829370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/80a96f6b7ce1aa50dc3e76f998f3a8dc.mp4?t=1785829370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and intuitive VR arcade skiing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across multiple sci-fi planets, each with its own unique atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct environments featuring planet-specific obstacles and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Courses designed to test your reflexes, precision, and control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes offering different ways to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based challenges that encourage replayability and continuous improvement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful, energetic cartoon-inspired visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable single-player VR experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/e1a77ab6ceaa5a6496c49252b993208f.poster.avif?t=1785829370\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/e1a77ab6ceaa5a6496c49252b993208f.webm?t=1785829370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/extras/e1a77ab6ceaa5a6496c49252b993208f.mp4?t=1785829370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback is essential to help us improve the game and make it even more fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out all the levels, let us know what you enjoyed, what you think could be improved, and report any bugs you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay updated on all the latest development news, follow us on our social media and, most importantly, join the Lagzilla Discord: see you there!</p>", "short_description": "A VR arcade ski race game that brings you to compete on different exoplanets to become the galaxy champion. Enjoy frentic races at high speed, try different modes, earn shiny medals and visit all the wonderful planets.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/6babf2d59ed96fc3b3f511b76f4cd6b2a6d38208/header.jpg?t=1785829370", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/c10cc6cd561d05515a10af21f22e065c650291d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785829370", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421740/c10c